# Hardware

This document describes the physical hardware used to build and run my home lab.

## Host System
- Device type: Desktop 
- CPU:  Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-6700
- RAM:  32.0 GB
- Storage: 500 GB SSD
- Network: Integrated Ethernet 

## Role in the Lab
The host system runs Oracle VirtualBox, which is used to host two Windows machines and two Linux
virtual machines that provide lab services.

## Design Considerations
- Hardware already available (no dedicated server hardware)
- Sufficient RAM to support all four VMs
- SSD storage for improved VM performance

## Future Improvements
- Increase RAM to support additional virtual machines
- Move to dedicated hardware for 24/7 uptime
